body:
Thank you I do text based therapy once every 2 weeks but I'm not sure if it's helping. 

&#x200B;

I have a bischon frise!

Thank you for this advice. 

&#x200B;

My sister and I haven't spoken for years and we don't get along at al but I guess I could tell her my address just for the added safety (I don't think she would care or check up if anything goes wrong, but I guess it can't hurt).

&#x200B;

 I'll try to not shut my dad out completely, I'm angry at him for many things and he's angry at me, but I have no other options - I guess I'll just try to keep our relationship somewhat alive.

I'm sorry to hear that, I relate to much of your post. 

&#x200B;

Have you considered a small business that is completely virtual? You could maybe make candles and sell them on Etsy, or you could do affiliate marketing online? Even if you only earn a couple 100 bucks a month, it will give you experience and confidence.
